      "kind": "calculation",
      "statement": "On Orvan -> Asgard, Maize, trade value fell by 55.97% (Oct-Dec 2026 vs Oct-Dec 2025) and volume by 61.42%. Volume fell further than value (61.42% against 55.97%), so the physical shortfall is larger than the value figure shows. Every month of the period is below its year-earlier level, so this is a sustained disruption, not a single bad month. Thor claims the measured trade value decline on orvan -> asgard, maize of 55.97%; 55.97% would be the net loss only if none of it is replaced, and the record does not measure replacement, so net exposure is not claimed as established.",
